// Title: Potential Persistence Via Outlook Form
// Rule ID: c3edc6a5-d9d4-48d8-930e-aab518390917
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1137.003
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
